{
 "dur": 73.9,
 "vo": [
  {
   "id": "v01",
   "t": 0.4,
   "chunks": [
    "This is",
    "Elon Musk's Neuralink.",
    "A coin-sized implant",
    "that listens to your brain."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v02",
   "t": 6.01,
   "chunks": [
    "Let's take it apart.",
    "A sealed case holds",
    "a small battery,",
    "charged wirelessly through the skin."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v03",
   "t": 12.07,
   "chunks": [
    "Inside, a custom chip",
    "processes the brain's tiny signals."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v04",
   "t": 16.08,
   "chunks": [
    "Below, 64 threads,",
    "thinner than a hair,",
    "carry 1,024 electrodes."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v05",
   "t": 21.73,
   "chunks": [
    "A surgical robot, R1,",
    "inserts them one by one,",
    "dodging blood vessels."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v06",
   "t": 27.51,
   "chunks": [
    "How does it work?",
    "Think about moving your hand,",
    "and neurons in your motor cortex fire."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v07",
   "t": 32.77,
   "chunks": [
    "Electrodes catch those spikes,",
    "and the chip sends them",
    "over Bluetooth to a computer."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v08",
   "t": 37.97,
   "chunks": [
    "Software decodes that pattern into intent,",
    "and the cursor moves."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v09",
   "t": 42.39,
   "chunks": [
    "In early 2024,",
    "the first participant,",
    "paralyzed below the shoulders,",
    "got the implant,",
    "and was soon playing chess by thought."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v10",
   "t": 51.16,
   "chunks": [
    "By early 2026:",
    "21 participants.",
    "Some have moved a robotic arm.",
    "Speech, and a vision implant called Blindsight,",
    "are in development."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v11",
   "t": 61.3,
   "chunks": [
    "Neuralink's goal:",
    "control phones and computers by thought.",
    "Musk has even said you could one day",
    "summon your Tesla with your mind."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v12",
   "t": 69.97,
   "chunks": [
    "What should we take apart next?"
   ]
  }
 ]
}